## Data and licensing

This repository contains analysis code developed for the computational analysis of publicly available transcriptomic data.

The study is based on previously generated RNA-seq data obtained from the NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO), including the GSE90894 RNA-seq SubSeries within the GSE90895 SuperSeries. The data were not generated as part of this project; they were downloaded from the public repository and subsequently processed and analyzed using the workflows provided in this repository.

The original datasets remain subject to the terms and conditions of their respective data repositories and source studies.

The original analysis code, scripts, and documentation developed for this project are released under the MIT License.

